<title>UK: Banco Dibens sets $50 million step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Dibens sets $50 million step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Dibens S.A. has launched a $50 million step-up bond, lead manager Credit Agricole said on Monday.</p>
<p>The bond will have an eight-year maturity with a put and call in year three. It will be priced later.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
